{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/733132-surprisingly-deadly-character-concepts","id":733132,"title":"Surprisingly Deadly Character Concepts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-27T14:56:24-07:00","id":733132,"title":"Surprisingly Deadly Character Concepts","content":"Hey guys,<br /> <br /> For a challenge, I'm looking for inspiration on how to create a character that is extraordinarily lethal, in the most unorthodox or innocent manner possible. The race can be anything except Kuei-Jin or Mage. I'm looking for unorthodox and out of the box ideas. Maybe share some of your previous character concepts?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4572-vorcen","name":"Vorcen","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T16:15:06-07:00","id":733330,"title":"","content":"A vampire infected with Ebola and has the infections bite flaw","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-27T18:19:45-07:00","id":733589,"title":"","content":"A Marauder who likes to play The Floor Is Lava...by changing the local ground to actual lava.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><a href=\"http://archiveofourown.org/works/6956863/chapters